        <profile name="Powers of the C&apos;tan (Vault)" id="4aa6-7472-a532-e277" hidden="false" page="108" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model knows four C&apos;tan Powers from the Powers of the C&apos;tan. At the end of your Movement phase, if this model did not Advance or Fall Back that phase, it can use a number of C&apos;tan Powers it knows equal to the number in the table below. It cannot use the same C&apos;tan Power more than once per turn.

16+ Wounds: 3 Powers
9-15 Wounds: 2 Powers
1-8 Wounds: 1 Power</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Tesseract Vault [2] (9-15 Wounds Remaining)" id="4167-5959-15e1-f303" hidden="false" page="108" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Unit">
