        <profile name="Powers of the C&apos;tan (Transcendent)" id="7a41-2746-12c1-ab00" hidden="false" page="98" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model knows two C&apos;tan Powers from the Powers of the C&apos;tan. At the end of your Movement phase, if this model did not Advance or Fall Back that phase, it can use one of the C&apos;tan Powers it knows. It cannot use the same C&apos;tan Power more than once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Fractured Personality (Instructions)" id="71d9-b6f6-5597-7774" hidden="false" page="100" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537">
          <description>Before the battle, select one of the abilities in the table to the right for this model to have for the duration of the battle. Alternatively, you can randomly determine two abilities from the table for this model to have by rolling two D6 and looking up the result (if a double is rolled, roll both dice again until two different results are rolled).

1) Cosmic tyrant
2) Immune to Natural Law
3) Sentient Necrodermis
4) Transdimensional Displacement
5) Untamed Power
6) Writhing Worldscape</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
