          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, you can select one friendly &lt;DYNASTY&gt; NECRON WARRIORS unit within 6&quot; of this model. If you do, up to D3 destroyed models from that unit Reanimate. Each unit can only be selected for this ability once per phase.</characteristic>
