              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During deployment, you can set up one &lt;DYNASTY&gt; MONOLITH or &lt;DYNASTY&gt; SENTRY PYLON model from your army on top of this unit’s Tomb Ziggurat model. If you do, until that Monolith or Sentry Pylon unit moves, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of weapons that model is equipped with.</characteristic>
