          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer has a Move characteristic of 10&quot; and the FLY keyword. In addition, at the end of your Movement phase, you can repair one friendly &lt;DYNASTY&gt; model within 3&quot; of this model. That model regains up to D3 lost wounds. Each model can only be repaired once per turn.</characteristic>
