          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b1f8-a131-2cef-6c8b">Each time a model with this code makes an attack with a Rapid Fire weapon that targets a unit within 12&quot;, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
