          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b1f8-a131-2cef-6c8b">VEHICLE units with this code are eligible to shoot in a turn in which they Fell Back, but if they do, then until the end of the turn, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, subtract 1 from that attack&apos;s hit roll.  VEHICLE models with this code do not suffer the penalty to hit rolls incurred for firing Heavy weapons while enemy units are within Engagement Range of their unit.</characteristic>
