            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon, if a hit is scored, draw a straight line between the closest point of this model&apos;s base (or hull) and that of the closest model in the target unit. Make one wound roll against the target unit, and each other unit this line passes over. Each time an attack made with this weapon is allocated to a VEHICLE model, that attack has a Damage characteristic of D3+3.</characteristic>
