            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer has the following ability: &apos;Control Node (Aura): While a friendly &lt;DYNASTY&gt; CANOPTEK unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to that attack&apos;s hit roll.&apos;</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
