        <profile name="Powers of the C&apos;tan (Void Dragon)" id="681a-85f0-915c-2e87" hidden="false" page="99" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model knows the Voltaic Storm C&apos;tan Power and one other C&apos;tan Power from the Powers of the C&apos;tan. At the end of your Movement phase, if this model did not Advance or Fall Back that phase, it can use two of the C&apos;tan Powers it knows. It cannot use the same C&apos;tan Power more than once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Matter Absorption" id="81b9-996b-703f-f19e" hidden="false" page="99" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of each phase, roll one D6 for each enemy VEHICLE model destroyed as a result of an attack made by this model or a C&apos;tan Power used by this model that phase; for each 2+, this model regains 1 lost wound (to a maximum of 3 regained wounds per phase).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
