        <profile name="Viral Construct" id="f0ab-0c60-9953-506f" hidden="false" page="96" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged, then for each &lt;DYNASTY&gt; DESTROYER CULT unit included in a Detachment, one &lt;DYNASTY&gt; CANOPTEK PLASMACYTE unit can be included in that Detachment without taking up a Battlefield Role slot. You cannot include more &lt;DYNASTY&gt; CANOPTEK PLASMACYTE units in a Detachment than there are &lt;DYNASTY&gt; DESTROYER CULT units in that Detachment. [Located in No Force Org]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Infused Madness" id="009f-fc31-9194-7c5b" hidden="false" page="96" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per turn, at the start of either your Charge phase or the Fight phase, you can select one friendly &lt;DYNASTY&gt; DESTROYER CULT unit within 3&quot; of this model. If you do, roll one D6: on a 1, one model in that unit is destroyed. Regardless of the result, until the end of the turn, add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of models in that unit. Each unit can only be selected for this ability once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Recall Protocol" id="b0a6-2135-1d4f-9b58" hidden="false" page="96" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In the Unit Coherency Checks step of the Morale phase, if this model is not within 6&quot; of any friendly &lt;DYNASTY&gt; DESTROYER CULT units, this model is destroyed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Evasion Protocol" id="943f-1495-3b28-47f0" hidden="false" page="96" publicationId="61c6-c8c5-pubN65537" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this model is within 3&quot; of a friendly &lt;DYNASTY&gt; DESTROYER CULT unit, enemy models cannot target this model with ranged weapons unless it is the closest eligible target. In addition, this unit cannot perform actions.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
