                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Select one melee weapon the bearer is equipped with. Each time an attack made with that weapon scores a hit, that attack inflicts 1 mortal wound in
addition to any normal damage. 
- When the bearer is destroyed, roll one D6 before removing it from play. On a 2+ it explodes, and each unit within 3&quot; suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
